Izanagi is an unofficial PC port of Shin Megami Tensei: Persona 4 (USA,
SLUS-21782). It is not affiliated with or endorsed by Atlus or SEGA. Persona,
Shin Megami Tensei and Atlus are trademarks of their owners. This repository
and its release packages contain no game data: players supply their own disc
image (docs/bring_your_own_iso.md).

